  "releaseNotes": "Kafka: SASL/OAUTHBEARER with OpenID Connect (Keycloak, Okta, Azure AD): WithOAuthBearer, UseOAuthBearer, or \"type\": \"OAuthBearer\" in testsettings.json. New samples: OAuth with Keycloak, and PLAIN + SCRAM on one broker. No code changes needed from 6.18.1. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
